    "title": "Community group schedules meeting in Eau Claire for Thursday, Aug. 20",
    "text": "Community group schedules meeting in Eau Claire for Thursday, Aug. 20\nOn Thursday, Aug. 20, a community organization will host a Chippewa Valley Stamp Club meeting in the City of Eau Claire.\nThe gathering is set to take place at the Chippewa Valley Stamp Club location, with a scheduled start time of 7 p.m.\nCommunity members interested in attending are encouraged to participate and engage in local discussions.",
